  "body": "The M880 family were near-stock 1976-77 Dodge W200 (4x4) and D200 (4x2) pickups. Engine, transmission and axle hardware are civilian parts, so these values apply to civilian trucks with the same components. Military-only items (24-volt kits, ambulance and shelter bodies) are left out.",
